# F#: F# Language Specification and "F# language reference" (F# 8); requirements/languages/fsharp.md
name     fsharp fs f#

keyword  abstract and as assert base begin class default delegate do done downcast downto elif else end
keyword  exception extern finally fixed for fun function global if in inherit inline interface internal
keyword  lazy let match member module mutable namespace new not of open or override private public rec
keyword  return select sig static struct then to try type upcast use val void when while with yield
builtin  true false null printfn printf sprintf failwith ignore id fst snd Some None raise box unbox
type     int float string bool unit char byte decimal int64 uint64 list option seq array exn obj

line-comment   //
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
string   ' '      : escapes
prefix   @        : verbatim
prefix   $        : interp=braces
escape        : x=2 u4 U8
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~@.
upper-type
